      <title>OpenAI下调GPT-5.6 Sol价格超20%，开发者成本大降</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260822/OpenAI%E4%B8%8B%E8%B0%83GPT-5.6-Sol%E4%BB%B7%E6%A0%BC%E8%B6%8520%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%8D/</link>
